      Invert Z Axis: false
      Name: Current View
      Near Clip Distance: 0.009999999776482582
      Scale: 654.3251953125
      Target Frame: world
      Value: TopDownOrtho (rviz_default_plugins)
      X: 0.47844043374061584
      Y: -0.0726453885436058
    Saved: ~
